<Plugin>
  <Name>Drive Placement</Name>
  <Overview><![CDATA[An interactive, drag-and-drop visualizer that maps your physical unRAID server layout to a virtual dashboard, so you always know which bay a drive lives in. Each drive card shows its temperature, usage, free space, type, and health at a glance, with custom naming, per-category and per-card background colors, a dark-skin aware theme, and layouts saved to your flash drive.]]></Overview>
